<title>USA: Gulf expects to sell stake in project.</title>
<headline>Gulf expects to sell stake in project.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd expects to sell 15 to 20 percent of its Indonesia Sumpal Bungkal discoveries for US$300 million to US$400 million in an initial public offering to be held in the third or fourth quarter of 1997, chief financial officer Craig Glick said.</p>
</text>
